OL,3,GNEWSACouncil mulls disposable barbecue
OL,4,Abeach ban
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council is considering a total ban on
OL,7,Fthe use of disposable barbecues on
OL,8,Fbeaches following this summer's spate
OL,9,Fof wildfires.
OL,11,FCornwall Council's cabinet member for
OL,12,Fcommunity safety Thalia Marrington said
OL,13,Fit has started looking at the
OL,14,Fpossibility of introducing a public
OL,15,Fspaces protection order to restrict
OL,16,Ftheir use.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,345,340,200,160,0,100
