OL,2,W//%*// //%Q--% (.*.. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,!
OL,3,GNEWSACouncil mulls disposable barbecue
OL,4,Abeach ban
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncillor James Mustoe, who has
OL,7,Fpreviously raised the issue, asked a
OL,8,Fwellbeing scrutiny meeting on 10
OL,9,FSeptember if it was time to ban
OL,10,Fdisposable barbecues, the Local
OL,11,FDemocracy Reporting Service said.
OL,13,FIt comes after housing, communities and
OL,14,Flocal government secretary Angela
OL,15,FRayner urged councils to consider
OL,16,Fbanning open fires, campfires and
OL,17,Fbarbecues in highly vulnerable areas.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
